{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/3596a1008cc43ad37c24cabdd437660e.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Sproutmart \u2014 a hands-on grocery store sim where you stock shelves, scan items at the checkout, and grow your business day by day. Set up your aisles, choose what to sell, and build a store that feels like your own.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ec12ce645dec491f499457ecd5eb51c6.poster.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ec12ce645dec491f499457ecd5eb51c6.webm?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ec12ce645dec491f499457ecd5eb51c6.mp4?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/a182402e8c1710c53c1c8af208db495d.webp?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/79be1494f3f7fdc0908675ddd1292ae1.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customers come in throughout the day, shelves need refilling, and the register gets busy. Stay organized, restock regularly, and keep everything flowing to earn more and expand faster. As you grow, hire NPC employees to help with tasks like restocking and checkout.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/41d278ce5b083f0711f8cc69b8260b82.poster.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/41d278ce5b083f0711f8cc69b8260b82.webm?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/41d278ce5b083f0711f8cc69b8260b82.mp4?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/a182402e8c1710c53c1c8af208db495d.webp?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/cbec64f6c54876f070d1f337415b1005.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start small and build up. Expand your space, unlock new products, and customize your shop with decorations so it looks and feels like your store \u2014 not just another layout.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ac50c28198f04acf556fdbd4c3e3ebc2.poster.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ac50c28198f04acf556fdbd4c3e3ebc2.webm?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/ac50c28198f04acf556fdbd4c3e3ebc2.mp4?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/a182402e8c1710c53c1c8af208db495d.webp?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/43084763f5aceaef6b539c3a4f9b34b6.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support your store with your own supply. Grow and prepare goods to stock your shelves, reduce costs, and keep popular items available without relying entirely on suppliers. Place crafting machines to turn ingredients into new products and expand what you can sell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/511c3bd0400241939038436499571832.poster.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/511c3bd0400241939038436499571832.webm?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/511c3bd0400241939038436499571832.mp4?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/a182402e8c1710c53c1c8af208db495d.webp?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/81e6d90c69b1f6332100022778b5d430.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step away from the counter and go fishing to bring back extra goods you can sell for profit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/07a1cd0b3568f7977b9e01e453c0ad28.poster.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/07a1cd0b3568f7977b9e01e453c0ad28.webm?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/07a1cd0b3568f7977b9e01e453c0ad28.mp4?t=1768223474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/a182402e8c1710c53c1c8af208db495d.webp?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/extras/b6e6cb7f7db58cd771b48597e7bac19a.avif?t=1768223474\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or team up online. Split tasks naturally \u2014 checkout, restocking, storage, farming, and more \u2014 and build your store together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mut